### 创建入库计划（createInboundPlan）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fulfillment-inbound/operations/createInboundPlan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"name":"Inbound plan","sourceAddress":{"name":"Warehouse","addressLine1":"1 Main St","city":"Seattle","stateOrProvinceCode":"WA","postalCode":"98101","countryCode":"US"},"items":[]}}

### 查询入库计划（getInboundPlan）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fulfillment-inbound/operations/getInboundPlan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"inboundPlanId":"PLAN_ID"}}

### 查询 v0 货件标签（getLabels）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fulfillment-inbound/operations/getLabels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"shipmentId":"SHIPMENT_ID"},"query":{"PageType":"PackageLabel_Letter_2"}}
